abstract: "An MCP server that gives agents and developers tools to estimate, budget, and compare the cost of LLM work per task: price_usage, estimate_run_cost, compare_models_for_task (ranked by cost per successful task), record_spend, and budget_status, over a maintained pricing snapshot with a local JSON ledger. Reference implementation for awslabs/mcp RFC #4772, built on tokenecon."
